usage: code-review-graph status [-h] [--repo REPO] [-q] [--json]
                                [--data-dir DATA_DIR]

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO          Repository root (auto-detected)
  -q, --quiet          Suppress output
  --json               Output one machine-readable JSON object
  --data-dir DATA_DIR  External directory to store graph database (useful for
                       network shares)
